          "type": "chapter",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "The Journey Begins",
            "text": "<p>More than ten years ago, Gypsey Rose began as a one-woman adventure to India. The founder, Tess, became fascinated by the ancient art of block printing, the purity of 100% cotton, the intricate and unique embroidery, and the incredible, timeless skills of Indian artisans.</p>"
          }
        },
        "mother_daughter": {
          "type": "chapter",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "A Rare and Beautiful Partnership",
            "text": "<p>A few years into the journey, Tess was joined by her beautiful daughter, Sam. Sharing a deep passion for the beauty that India has to offer with a loved one is a true gift. Together, Tess and Sam have nurtured a rare and beautiful partnership.</p><p>The duo travels to India twice a year to personally source and design fabrics, translating their shared inspiration into thoughtfully created garments.</p>"
          }
        },
        "india": {
          "type": "chapter",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Crafted with Love",
            "text": "<p>Over the years, Gypsey Rose has built special, close relationships with its manufacturers. Even when things are occasionally lost in translation, the journey continues with absolute love, patience, and passion. The brand embraces <strong>“Manifesting, Mantras, and Magical Moments”</strong> at every step of the way.</p>"
          }
        },
        "cotton": {
          "type": "chapter",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Travel with Tess",
            "text": "<p>Alongside clothing production, Tess nurtures her deep love for exploring India. For those who share her passion for travel, Tess also facilitates and hosts small-group journeys to many of her favourite and diverse destinations across the country.</p>"
          }
        },
