            "text": "<p>Locally, the unique garments can be explored in person at the <a href=\"/pages/contact\" title=\"Gypsey Rose Showroom in Roosevelt Park, Johannesburg\">Gypsey Rose Showroom in Roosevelt Park, Johannesburg</a>.</p>"
